{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02420","headline":"奉和正日临朝 · 颜师古","name":"奉和正日临朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"七府璿衡始，三元宝历新。\n负扆延百辟，垂旒御九宾。\n肃肃皆鵷鹭，济济盛簪绅。\n天涯致重译，日域献奇珍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜师古","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}